  "body": "https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-create-element step 6.1.3 throws a `TypeError` if the thing the constructor returns is not an HTMLElement.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#concept-upgrade-an-element step 8.2 throws an InvalidStateError DOMException.\r\n\r\nIt would be good to be consistent here, especially if we're going to move that typecheck down into the IDL machinery via <https://github.com/heycam/webidl/issues/701>.  At that point this will automatically be a `TypeError`, which is why I'm filing this here and not in DOM.\r\n\r\n@domenic @annevk ",
